# Meta WhatsApp Embedded Signup (onboarding Step 3 — "Connect WhatsApp").
#
# Both values are PUBLIC client-side ids (they end up in the popup URL either
# way) — the Meta app SECRET must NOT go here; it belongs on the backend, which
# is what exchanges the auth code this popup returns.
#
# Where to find them:
#   VITE_META_APP_ID    — Meta App Dashboard → your app → App ID
#   VITE_META_CONFIG_ID — Meta App Dashboard → WhatsApp → Embedded Signup
#                         → your configuration → Configuration ID
#
# When these are unset, Step 3 shows an explicit "not configured on this
# environment yet" notice and lets the user skip, instead of opening a popup
# that would just error out. Set them in Vercel for the deployed app.
VITE_META_APP_ID=
VITE_META_CONFIG_ID=
